      },
      "dc:source": "an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(3) It is sufficient compliance with a requirement under subsection (2)\nto give a person (other than a court) a notice of transfer if the\ntransferee authority takes reasonable steps to give the notice to the\nperson.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) It is sufficient compliance with a requirement under subsection (2)\nto give a person (other than a court) a notice of transfer if the\ntransferee authority takes reasonable steps to give the notice to the\nperson.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-315b"
