      "values:originalText": "Omit “If the *DPP has previously applied to a *registration authority\nunder section 34 for the recording in a register of particulars of a\n*restraining order covering particular property, the DPP”, substitute “If\nthe *responsible authority for a *restraining order covering particular\nproperty has previously applied to a *registration authority under\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859\n\nSchedule 2  Proceeds of crime amendments",
