      "values:originalText": "After “Director of Public Prosecutions”, insert “(or the Commissioner\nof the Australian Federal Police, if the Commissioner is the\nCommonwealth proceeds of crime authority that is the responsible\nauthority for the order under the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002)”.\nNote:\nThe heading to section 114C is altered by inserting “or Commissioner of the\nAustralian Federal Police” after “Director of Public Prosecutions”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859\n\nSchedule 2  Proceeds of crime amendments",
      "skos:definition": "After “Director of Public Prosecutions”, insert “(or the Commissioner\nof the Australian Federal Police, if the Commissioner is the\nCommonwealth proceeds of crime authority that is the responsible\nauthority for the order under the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002)”.\nNote:\nThe heading to section 114C is altered by inserting “or Commissioner of the\nAustralian Federal Police” after “Director of Public Prosecutions”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859\n\nSchedule 2  Proceeds of crime amendments",
