      },
      "dc:source": "an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments of the Crimes Act 1914 made by items 151 and 152 of\nthis Schedule apply as set out in this item.\n(2)\nThe amendments apply in relation to proceedings under the Proceeds of\nCrime Act 2002 started before, at or after the commencement of those\nitems.\n(3)\nThe amendments apply under subitem (2) of this item regardless of\nwhether the conduct giving rise to those proceedings occurred, or is\nsuspected to have occurred, before, at or after the commencement of\nthose items.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859\n\nSchedule 2  Proceeds of crime amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments of the Crimes Act 1914 made by items 151 and 152 of\nthis Schedule apply as set out in this item.\n(2)\nThe amendments apply in relation to proceedings under the Proceeds of\nCrime Act 2002 started before, at or after the commencement of those\nitems.\n(3)\nThe amendments apply under subitem (2) of this item regardless of\nwhether the conduct giving rise to those proceedings occurred, or is\nsuspected to have occurred, before, at or after the commencement of\nthose items.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859\n\nSchedule 2  Proceeds of crime amendments",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-153-norm"
        }
      ],
