      "cml:premiseText": "If an order is made under a State or Territory proceeds of crime law and that is of a kind declared by the regulations to be a freezing order for the purposes of this paragraph, then it is a freezing order",
      "cml:conclusionText": "State or Territory proceeds of crime law implies freezing order if it is of a kind declared by the regulations"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-158-logic-ltl-5",
