      "dc:source": "an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “the DPP”, substitute “the authority”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859\n\nProceeds of crime amendments  Schedule 2\nResponsible authorities for proceeds of crime: the DPP and the AFP  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment Act (No. 2) 2011          29",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “the DPP”, substitute “the authority”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00859\n\nProceeds of crime amendments  Schedule 2\nResponsible authorities for proceeds of crime: the DPP and the AFP  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment Act (No. 2) 2011          29",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the-sch-2-sec-182-norm"
