      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nproceeds of crime authority has the same meaning as in the\nProceeds of Crime Act.\nNote:\nUnder that Act, the proceeds of crime authority is either the\nCommissioner of the Australian Federal Police or the Director of\nPublic Prosecutions (see the definition of proceeds of crime authority\nin section 338 of that Act).",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nproceeds of crime authority has the same meaning as in the\nProceeds of Crime Act.\nNote:\nUnder that Act, the proceeds of crime authority is either the\nCommissioner of the Australian Federal Police or the Director of\nPublic Prosecutions (see the definition of proceeds of crime authority\nin section 338 of that Act).",
