      "dc:source": "an-act-to-amend-various-acts-relating-to-the-enforcement-of-the.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "After “has paid”, insert “before the application for the order is made”.\nNote:\nThe following heading to subsection 131(1) is inserted “Tax paid before application for\norder is made”.",
      "skos:definition": "After “has paid”, insert “before the application for the order is made”.\nNote:\nThe following heading to subsection 131(1) is inserted “Tax paid before application for\norder is made”.",
      "cml:asserts": [
